2	 * The programmatic node representation (03 architecture, section 2), as the board and graph.json see it.
3	 * Field names match section 2 so later milestones add fields without renames.
4	 *
5	 * FROZEN CONTRACT (M1, docs/m1-plan.md section 5). Builders may only add OPTIONAL fields, and must record the
