4	 *
5	 * Lean reports message positions as a 1-based line and a 0-based column counted in Unicode code points; the board
6	 * (and the `.ilean` files) use LSP positions: 0-based line and UTF-16 code units. A character outside the Basic
7	 * Multilingual Plane (e.g. `𝔸`) is one code point but two UTF-16 units, so columns after it differ.
